          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Contact • {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Connect with {{COACH_NAME}} — schedule a consult, ask about programs, or download the wellbeing guide.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg:#f7fafb; --card:#ffffff; --muted:#6b7280; --accent:#0f766e; --accent-2:#075985; --glass:rgba(15,118,110,0.06);\\n      --radius:12px; --max:1100px; --gap:24px; --mono:ui-monospace,monospace;\\n    }\\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,\\\"Helvetica Neue\\\",Arial;color:#0f172a;background:var(--bg);}\\n    a{color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none}\\n    header{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(15,118,110,0.06),transparent);backdrop-filter:blur(4px);}\\n    .container{max-width:var(--max);margin:32px auto;padding:28px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:var(--gap)}\\n    .topbar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}\\n    .logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}\\n    .logo-mark{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--glass);display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)}\\n    nav a{margin-left:18px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;align-items:start}\\n    .hero-card{background:var(--card);padding:26px;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);display:grid;grid-template-columns:72px 1fr;gap:18px;align-items:center}\\n    .avatar{width:72px;height:72px;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:grid;place-items:center;color:white;font-weight:700}\\n    h1{font-size:20px;margin:0;color:#0b1220}\\n    p.lead{margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .card{background:var(--card);padding:22px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(15,23,42,0.04)}\\n    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n    .contact-info{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\\n    .pill{display:inline-flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;background:var(--glass);padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;color:var(--accent)}\\n    form{display:grid;gap:12px}\\n    input,textarea,select{width:100%;padding:12px;border:1px solid #e6eef0;border-radius:10px;font-size:14px}\\n    button.primary{background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:0;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}\\n    .meta{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}\\n    .benefits{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:12px}\\n    .benefit{padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ffffff, #fbfdfd);border:1px solid #eef6f6}\\n    .process{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-top:12px}\\n    .step{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start}\\n    .step .num{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:9px;background:var(--accent);color:white;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:700}\\n    .faq{margin-top:14px}\\n    .faq-item{margin-bottom:12px}\\n    .testimonial{border-left:4px solid var(--glass);padding-left:12px;color:var(--muted);font-style:italic}\\n    footer{margin-top:28px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    @media (max-width:880px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.container{padding:18px}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <header>\\n    <div class=\\\"container topbar\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"logo\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"logo-mark\\\">W</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav aria-label=\\\"Primary\\\">\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">About</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"programs.html\\\">Work With Me</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Investment</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book a VIP Day</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent)\\\">Contact</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </div>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <section class=\\\"hero-card\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"avatar\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n        <img src=\\\"assets/img/avatar.svg\\\" alt=\\\"{{COACH_NAME}}\\\" style=\\\"width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover\\\">\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <h1>Reach out to {{COACH_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">I help busy people in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} build sustainable habits and practical routines. Share where you are and what outcome matters most — we’ll craft the next step together.</p>\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\" class=\\\"meta\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Call: {{PHONE}}</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Email: {{EMAIL}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n      <aside>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h2 style=\\\"margin:0 0 6px\\\">Quick ways to connect</h2>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Choose a preferred path and I’ll respond within 48 hours.</p>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\" class=\\\"contact-info\\\">\\n            <div><strong>Phone</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">{{PHONE}} — for scheduling and quick questions</div></div>\\n            <div><strong>Email</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">{{EMAIL}} — for detailed inquiries and attachments</div></div>\\n            <div><strong>Book a VIP Day</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">Prefer a focused deep-dive? <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Reserve your VIP Day</a></div></div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <hr style=\\\"margin:18px 0;border:none;border-top:1px solid #eef6f6\\\">\\n\\n          <div>\\n            <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 6px\\\">Why coaches choose this approach</h3>\\n            <p class=\\\"muted\\\">A clinical, habit-first framework that centers small, measurable shifts. No quick fixes — steady progress.</p>\\n            <div class=\\\"benefits\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"benefit\\\"><strong>Clarity</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">Define one measurable target each week.</div></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"benefit\\\"><strong>Structure</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">Simple routines you can follow in busy weeks.</div></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"benefit\\\"><strong>Accountability</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">Gentle check-ins that keep momentum.</div></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"benefit\\\"><strong>Tools</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">Templates, trackers, and quick habit scripts.</div></div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <hr style=\\\"margin:18px 0;border:none;border-top:1px solid #eef6f6\\\">\\n\\n          <div>\\n            <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 6px\\\">What clients say</h3>\\n            <div class=\\\"testimonial\\\">“After three months I finally had a simple morning routine that stuck. {{COACH_NAME}} made it feel doable.” — A. W.</div>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\" class=\\\"muted\\\">See more <a href=\\\"testimonials.html\\\">testimonials</a>.</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\" class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 6px\\\">Download: 7-Day Reset (Free)</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">A compact planner with prompts to reset your rhythm, experiment with one habit, and track progress.</p>\\n          <form id=\\\"lead-form-inline\\\" onsubmit=\\\"return handleLead(event)\\\">\\n            <input name=\\\"name\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your name\\\" required>\\n            <input name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Email to send PDF\\\" required>\\n            <button class=\\\"primary\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Send the 7-Day Reset</button>\\n          </form>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n\\n      <section>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h2 style=\\\"margin:0 0 6px\\\">Start a conversation</h2>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Fill this form and I’ll reply with next steps. Selecting a program helps me prepare a tailored plan.</p>\\n\\n          <form id=\\\"contact-form\\\" onsubmit=\\\"return handleSubmit(event)\\\">\\n            <input name=\\\"name\\\" placeholder=\\\"Full name\\\" required>\\n            <input name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Email\\\" required>\\n            <input name=\\\"phone\\\" placeholder=\\\"Phone (optional)\\\">\\n            <select name=\\\"interest\\\">\\n              <option value=\\\"\\\">Which option best fits?</option>\\n              <option>VIP Day — focused transformation</option>\\n              <option>8-week Coaching Path</option>\\n              <option>Monthly Accountability</option>\\n              <option>Custom corporate workshop</option>\\n            </select>\\n            <textarea name=\\\"message\\\" rows=\\\"5\\\" placeholder=\\\"Tell me about your current routine and one thing you'd like to change\\\"></textarea>\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:6px\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"font-size:13px\\\">Or call <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong></div>\\n              <div>\\n                <button class=\\\"primary\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div id=\\\"form-status\\\" role=\\\"status\\\" aria-live=\\\"polite\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted);\\\"></div>\\n          </form>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n            <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 6px\\\">How work flows</h3>\\n            <div class=\\\"process\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"step\\\"><div class=\\\"num\\\">1</div><div><strong>Intro call</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">15–30 minutes to set priorities.</div></div></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"step\\\"><div class=\\\"num\\\">2</div><div><strong>Plan</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">A realistic plan with weekly targets and tools.</div></div></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"step\\\"><div class=\\\"num\\\">3</div><div><strong>Refine</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">Adjust based on what works; keep what’s simple.</div></div></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"step\\\"><div class=\\\"num\\\">4</div><div><strong>Sustain</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">Small systems that become habit over months.</div></div></div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"faq\\\">\\n            <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Questions I often receive</h3>\\n            <div class=\\\"faq-item\\\">\\n              <strong>How soon can I book a VIP Day?</strong>\\n              <div class=\\\"muted\\\">VIP Days are scheduled with limited availability; include preferred dates and times and I’ll confirm options.</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"faq-item\\\">\\n              <strong>Do you work virtually?</strong>\\n              <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Yes — most coaching and VIP Days are virtual. If in-person is needed, mention location in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"faq-item\\\">\\n              <strong>Is this medical advice?</strong>\\n              <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Coaching focuses on habits and behavior change, not medical diagnosis. If you have medical concerns, please consult a licensed professional.</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\" class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 6px\\\">Ready for a focused day?</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">The VIP Day is an immersive session to redesign a routine or system. It’s ideal for clients wanting fast, structured change.</p>\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:10px\\\">\\n            <a class=\\\"primary\\\" style=\\\"display:inline-block;padding:10px 12px;text-decoration:none;color:white;border-radius:10px\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Book a VIP Day</a>\\n            <a href=\\\"programs.html\\\" style=\\\"align-self:center;color:var(--accent-2);font-weight:600\\\">See programs</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div>© <span id=\\\"year\\\"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{COACH_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}} • <a href=\\\"privacy.html\\\">Privacy</a></div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <script>\\n    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();\\n\\n    function handleLead(e){\\n      e.preventDefault();\\n      var f = e.target;\\n      var name = f.name.value || 'Friend';\\n      var email = f.email.value;\\n      document.getElementById('form-status').textContent = 'Sending your guide...';\\n      // Simulate download send — replace with actual API\\n      setTimeout(function(){\\n        document.getElementById('form-status').textContent = 'Check ' + email + ' for your 7-Day Reset.';\\n        f.reset();\\n      },800);\\n      return false;\\n    }\\n\\n    function handleSubmit(e){\\n      e.preventDefault();\\n      var f = e.target;\\n      var name = f.name.value.trim();\\n      var email = f.email.value.trim();\\n      if(!name || !email){\\n        document.getElementById('form-status').textContent = 'Please include your name and email.';\\n        return false;\\n      }\\n      document.getElementById('form-status').textContent = 'Sending your message...';\\n      // Minimal client-side handling — integrate server-side endpoint as needed\\n      setTimeout(function(){\\n        document.getElementById('form-status').textContent = 'Thanks, ' + name + '. I will reply within 48 hours.';\\n        f.reset();\\n        // Optionally navigate to booking if they selected VIP\\n        var interest = f.interest.value || '';\\n        if(interest.toLowerCase().includes('vip')){\\n          setTimeout(function(){ window.location.href = '{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'; }, 600);\\n        }\\n      },900);\\n      return false;\\n    }\\n  </script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"Contact Page — {{BUSINESS_NAME}} (clinic_modern)\\n\\nOverview:\\nThis contact.html is a premium, clinic_modern contact template tailored for a wellness coach with a gentle therapist voice. It includes the required section pack echoed from the home template: hero, social_proof, benefits, process, faq, lead_magnet, and cta. The layout is a two-column responsive grid that prioritizes clear contact paths and quick actions (download lead magnet, contact form, book VIP Day).\\n\\nFiles in this bundle chunk:\\n- contact.html — page for visitor contact, lead capture, FAQ, and CTAs.\\n- README.md — this file.\\n\\nPlaceholders (replace these before publishing):\\n- {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — the practice or brand name\\n- {{TAGLINE}} — brief site tagline\\n- {{PHONE}} — main contact phone number\\n- {{EMAIL}} — contact email address\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}} — main CTA button text (e.g., \\\"Schedule a Call\\\")\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} — main CTA href (booking link)\\n- {{COACH_NAME}} — coach's full name\\n- {{CREDENTIALS}} — credentials (e.g., PCC, MSW)\\n- {{CITY}} — local city\\n- {{STATE}} — local state\\n\\nBehavior & Integration Notes:\\n- The contact form and inline lead magnet form have lightweight client-side handlers (no external services). Replace setTimeout simulation with your backend endpoint to persist leads and trigger emails.\\n- The VIP Day CTA points to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}. Update this to your scheduler (Calendly, Acuity, or an internal booking page).\\n- All assets referenced (avatar.svg, hero.svg, pattern.svg) are local paths under assets/img/. Ensure those SVG files are included in the final site bundle.\\n\\nStyling & Accessibility:\\n- Uses simple, self-contained CSS variables and responsive grid. No external fonts or CDNs.\\n- Buttons and forms include semantic elements and aria-live support for status messages.\\n\\nCustomization Tips:\\n- To change color accents, modify --accent and --accent-2 in the :root block.\\n- To shorten the header links, edit the <nav> in the header.\\n- If you want form submissions to open a mail client, modify handleSubmit to use a mailto: link or integrate a POST to your API.\\n\\nDeveloper Handoff:\\n- Replace placeholders with real values before launching.\\n- Provide backend endpoints for lead capture and contact messages, and update the JS handlers accordingly.\\n- Add the SVG assets to assets/img/ (unique SVGs required for each template):\\n  - assets/img/hero.svg\\n  - assets/img/avatar.svg\\n  - assets/img/pattern.svg\\n\\nLegal & Content Guidance:\\n- The copy avoids medical claims and focuses on habits, outcomes, and frameworks in keeping with wellness coach realism rules.\\n- Keep the FAQ line clarifying that coaching is not medical advice.\\n\\nTesting:\\n1. Open contact.html in a browser locally.\\n2. Test the lead magnet form — you should see a simulated confirmation message.\\n3. Test the contact form — fill name and email to see a simulated response and VIP Day redirect if selected.\\n\\nQuestions or edits needed? Update copy, placeholders, or provide API endpoints to wire up form handling and lead delivery.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
